.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
db.sqlite3
.env
.git

# Runtime data, never build input. `media/` is a developer's real uploaded
# photos (gitignored for that reason) — `COPY . .` would bake them into every
# locally built image, and their subdirectories would land root-owned inside it,
# past the chown in the Dockerfile. In production both directories come from
# elsewhere anyway: media from the bind-mounted volume, staticfiles from
# `collectstatic` at boot. In dev the bind mount supplies them, so excluding
# them here changes nothing there.
media/
staticfiles/
